MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- COUNCIL_SEATS constant: First-Principles Analyst, Skeptic, Pragmatist,
  Researcher (names+duties from the llm-council skill protocol)
- normalize forces every preset onto the 4 seats positionally; unassigned
  seats are legal and skipped by the engine; extra/renamed seats rejected
  at the write boundary (422)
- role now steers stage-1 via a per-seat system message; stage-2 stays
  anonymous (sentinel tests prove no name/role/model-id leaks to reviewers)
- panel: seat name + duty shown as static text, provider/model dropdowns
  only — no add/remove member, no name/role inputs, no preset create/
  delete/set-default controls
- model menu: 'Council: <preset>' rows now show the seat names underneath
  (preset_members on the virtual picker row)
- CLI: 'hermes council list' prints seats with duties; configure walks the
  4 fixed seats (keep/pick/unassign) + judge + chairman
- defaults: council preset ships unassigned (strictly opt-in, no silent billing)
- tests: 70 passed (35 council python + moa regression + inventory); desktop
  tsc 0 errors, vitest 36+44 passed
